+ ## Varianti

- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Code
- column  Reason
- column  Message
+ column  Codice
+ column  Motivo
+ column  Messaggio

- row  `↯/s.68.2.1`  `Unreadable`  `[↯/s.68.2.1] the vocabulary could not be read`
+ row  `↯/s.68.2.1`  `Unreadable`  `[↯/s.68.2.1] the vocabulary could not be read`

